    "detailed_description": "Cotton Reboot! is a completely remastered version of Cotton.Fantastic Night Dreams, the originator of the witchy shooting game released 30 years ago, with new features and the latest visual design.<br>The game also features 3 game modes.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> X68000 original mode </li></ul>faithfully emulates Sharp\u2019s personal computer from the 1993 version.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Arrange mode</li></ul>features 16:9 screens, redesigned graphics and characters.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Time attack mode</li></ul>the player competes for scores online within a limited time.(2 minute and 5 minute mode can be selected)<br><br>Cotton reboot!\u3000Ver 1.01 update patch is now available.<br><br><br>1. controller button notation<br>\u3000Xbox controllers and other controllers (general Xinput-compatible controllers and DirectX-compatible controllers)<br>\u3000When connected, the button notations have been modified to conform to the Xbox controller specifications.<br>\u3000PS4 controller is still used when connected to a PS4 controller.<br>\u3000If a PS4 controller is not connected, the buttons will be displayed as Xbox buttons.<br><br>2. Addition of the game exit menu<br>\u3000Added to the main menu.<br><br>3. Screen mode change menu added<br>\u3000An item has been added to the config to allow selection of full screen mode or windowed mode.<br>\u3000If you change the mode and save the configuration, the next time you start up the system, the screen mode will be the one selected at the time of saving.<br><br>4. speed adjustment for monitors with a refresh rate of 60 Hz or higher<br>\u3000Changed speed management to be independent of refresh rate when in window mode.<br><br>Translated with  (free version)",
    "about_the_game": "Cotton Reboot! is a completely remastered version of Cotton.Fantastic Night Dreams, the originator of the witchy shooting game released 30 years ago, with new features and the latest visual design.<br>The game also features 3 game modes.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> X68000 original mode </li></ul>faithfully emulates Sharp\u2019s personal computer from the 1993 version.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Arrange mode</li></ul>features 16:9 screens, redesigned graphics and characters.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Time attack mode</li></ul>the player competes for scores online within a limited time.(2 minute and 5 minute mode can be selected)<br><br>Cotton reboot!\u3000Ver 1.01 update patch is now available.<br><br><br>1. controller button notation<br>\u3000Xbox controllers and other controllers (general Xinput-compatible controllers and DirectX-compatible controllers)<br>\u3000When connected, the button notations have been modified to conform to the Xbox controller specifications.<br>\u3000PS4 controller is still used when connected to a PS4 controller.<br>\u3000If a PS4 controller is not connected, the buttons will be displayed as Xbox buttons.<br><br>2. Addition of the game exit menu<br>\u3000Added to the main menu.<br><br>3. Screen mode change menu added<br>\u3000An item has been added to the config to allow selection of full screen mode or windowed mode.<br>\u3000If you change the mode and save the configuration, the next time you start up the system, the screen mode will be the one selected at the time of saving.<br><br>4. speed adjustment for monitors with a refresh rate of 60 Hz or higher<br>\u3000Changed speed management to be independent of refresh rate when in window mode.<br><br>Translated with  (free version)",
